   "reproduction": "unreproduced: an end-to-end retry through the executor process needs the full engine harness; the mechanism is shown from code",
   "evidence": "In-process, engine.ts:647 and engine.ts:1523 wrap the first run and its retries in `commandScope(cwd, ...)`. withCommandScratch (sandbox.ts:256-267) reuses the outer scratch, and runConfined sets HOME/XDG_CACHE_HOME/CARGO_HOME to that scratch (sandbox.ts:369-374). Through the executor, each job calls executeGate\u2192runLocalGates\u2192withCommandScratch with no outer scope, so every job creates and then removes its own scratch. lan.ts:44 `freshCheckoutFor: (repo) => !inplace && ...` returns false for in-place jobs, so retries get `setup: freshCheckout ? cfg.setup : []` = [] (run.ts:314/341). Setup output kept in scratch is therefore missing on an executor retry."
  },
